{"id": "rev-long-01", "text": "帮我审查下面这段订单服务代码，重点看并发和异常处理：\n```python\nimport threading\n\nclass OrderService:\n    def __init__(self, db):\n        self.db = db\n        self.cache = {}\n        self.lock = threading.Lock()\n\n    def step_0(self, order_id):\n        order = self.cache.get(order_id) or self.db.load(order_id)\n        order['step'] = 0\n        self.db.save(order)\n    def step_1(self, order_id):\n        order = self.cache.get(order_id) or self.db.load(order_id)\n        order['step'] = 1\n        self.db.save(order)\n    def step_2(self, order_id):\n        order = self.cache.get(order_id) or self.db.load(order_id)\n        order['step'] = 2\n        self.db.save(order)\n    def step_3(self, order_id):\n        order = self.cache.get(order_id) or self.db.load(order_id)\n        order['step'] = 3\n        self.db.save(order)\n    def step_4(self, order_id):\n        order = self.cache.get(order_id) or self.db.load(order_id)\n        order['step'] = 4\n        self.db.save(order)\n    def step_5(self, order_id):\n        order = self.cache.get(order_id) or self.db.load(order_id)\n        order['step'] = 5\n        self.db.save(order)\n    def step_6(self, order_id):\n        order = self.cache.get(order_id) or self.db.load(order_id)\n        order['step'] = 6\n        self.db.save(order)\n    def step_7(self, order_id):\n        order = self.cache.get(order_id) or self.db.load(order_id)\n        order['step'] = 7\n        self.db.save(order)\n    def step_8(self, order_id):\n        order = self.cache.get(order_id) or self.db.load(order_id)\n        order['step'] = 8\n        self.db.save(order)\n```", "tags": ["review", "review-long"], "expect_action": "delegate", "expect_role": "reviewer", "by_review_mode": {"direct": {"expect_action": "respond", "expect_role": null}}, "note": "约 47 行代码：auto 模式应交给审查"}
